OL,3,GNEWSAReform members will not get vote
OL,4,Aon new Welsh leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform's membership will not get a vote
OL,7,Fon who replaces its former Welsh party
OL,8,Fleader Dan Thomas, according to its
OL,9,Fchief whip in the Senedd.
OL,11,FThomas quit on Tuesday after he was
OL,12,Farrested over the weekend on suspicion
OL,13,Fof assault and controlling or coercive
OL,14,Fbehaviour. He was bailed pending
OL,15,Ffurther enquiries, and denies doing
OL,16,Fanything wrong.
OL,18,FPowell told Radio Wales Breakfast that
OL,19,FReform's 33 Senedd members will have a
OL,20,Fvote if there is more than one
OL,21,Fcandidate.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
