OL,3,GNEWSAReform members will not get vote
OL,4,Aon new Welsh leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, James Evans, Reform MS,
OL,7,Fruled himself out on Wednesday despite
OL,8,Fsaying he had support from the majority
OL,9,Fof the party group.
